WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.227
It started here.

00:00:01.227 --> 00:00:02.897
February twenty-fifteen.

00:00:02.897 --> 00:00:05.920
The Supreme Court struck down the ban on assisted dying.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.886
They gave Parliament twelve months to build safeguards.

00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:14.238
What Parliament built instead was a killing machine, with an off-switch they never intended to install.
